{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14040","headline":"晚春青门林亭燕集 · 耿湋","name":"晚春青门林亭燕集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都门连骑出，东野柳如丝。\n秦苑看山处，王孙逐草时。\n欢游难再得，衰老是前期。\n林静莺啼远，春深日过迟。\n落花今夕思，秉烛古人诗。\n对酒当爲乐，双杯未可辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}